{"id":"ae_rien","lemma":"aérien","pos":"adj","rank":4086,"glosses":["air; aerial"],"ipa":"/a.e.ʁjɛ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4a/Fr-a%C3%A9rien.ogg/Fr-a%C3%A9rien.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"aérienne","masculinePlural":"aériens","femininePlural":"aériennes"},"formAudio":{"aérienne":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-a%C3%A9rienne.wav","aériens":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/36/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-a%C3%A9riens.wav","aériennes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/07/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-a%C3%A9riennes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous avons un support aérien.","en":"We have air support.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"support"},null]},{"text":"Il a survécu à un crash aérien.","en":"He survived the plane crash.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to survive","l":"survivre"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"crash landing"},null]},{"text":"Tom est contrôleur aérien.","en":"Tom is an air traffic controller.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"controller, inspector"},null]},{"text":"La compagnie aérienne a immobilisé sa flotte.","en":"The airline has grounded its fleet.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"company"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to immobilize","l":"immobiliser"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"water"}]},{"text":"Je préfère voyager par train plutôt que par voie aérienne.","en":"I prefer traveling by train to flying.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to prefer","l":"préférer"},{"g":"to travel, to voyage"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"train"},{"g":"rather, instead"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"way, track"},null]}]}